{
  "info": {
    "name": "Eventrix Backend API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Postman collection for the current Eventrix backend routes.\n\n🔑 **TOKEN FLOW**:\n1. Bootstrap an admin with `POST /admins/bootstrap` or create one with `POST /admins` after login.\n2. Log in with `POST /auth/login` and store the returned token in `{{accessToken}}`.\n3. All protected requests reuse `{{accessToken}}`.\n4. `POST /events` auto-creates the organizer profile for the logged-in user and returns `organizerId` for follow-up organizer requests.\n\n🧪 **RECOMMENDED RUN ORDER**:\n1. `POST /auth/register` for a regular user.\n2. `POST /admins/bootstrap` to seed the first admin record.\n3. `POST /auth/login` to capture `{{accessToken}}`.\n4. `POST /admins` to create a protected admin record.\n5. `POST /categories` to capture category IDs.\n6. `POST /events` to capture `eventId` and `organizerId`.\n7. `GET /events/my-events` and `GET /events/pending` to verify event visibility.\n8. `POST /participants` plus the `users/me` and `participants/me` profile routes.\n9. Use the captured IDs for update and delete flows."
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000/api", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userRole", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminBootstrapId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "organizerId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "participantId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "categoryId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "categoryId2", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "categoryId3", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "eventId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
